101	 *
102	 * Walks the event array in order. Consecutive `content` events whose tool_use
103	 * blocks are all collapsible (reads, searches, listings) — plus their
104	 * corresponding `result` events — are merged into a single `CollapsedGroup`.
105	 *
106	 * Groups of 1 are not collapsed (no benefit to summarizing a single tool call).
107	 * Non-collapsible events (writes, executes, agent ops) always pass through
